---
import { isEnglishGuide } from './locale';
import { lastChecked, releaseVersion } from '~/site';
const english = isEnglishGuide(Astro.url);
---

<p class="site-note">
  {english ? 'Last checked' : '마지막 확인일'}: {lastChecked} (KST) · {english ? 'Release' : '배포본'} {releaseVersion}
  <br />
  {english ? 'The programs and people in the screenshots are examples created for this guide.' : '화면 속 프로그램과 사람은 안내를 위해 만든 예시입니다.'}
  {english && <><br />The product interface and screenshots remain in Korean. This is an English guide, not an English version of the product.</>}
</p>

<style>
  .site-note {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    word-break: keep-all;
  }
</style>
